so true of any other abilities that modify how a land enters the battlefield or apply \"as\" a land enters the battlefield, such as the first ability of Cavern of Souls.","oracle_id":"94fac5fe-97d5-4c12-a80c-8efff9d853ae","published_at":"2020-08-07","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If a nonbasic land has an ability that triggers \"when\" it enters the battlefield, it will lose that ability before it can trigger.","oracle_id":"94fac5fe-97d5-4c12-a80c-8efff9d853ae","published_at":"2020-08-07","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Nonbasic lands will lose any other land types and abilities they had. They will gain the land type Mountain and gain the ability \"{T}: Add {R}.\"","oracle_id":"94fac5fe-97d5-4c12-a80c-8efff9d853ae","published_at":"2020-08-07","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This effect doesn't affect names or supertypes. It won't turn any land into a basic land or remove the legendary supertype from a legendary land, and the lands won't be named \"Mountain.\"","oracle_id":"94fac5fe-97d5-4c12-a80c-8efff9d853ae","published_at":"2020-08-07","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This is not modal. If the target changes from an artifact to an enchantment or vice versa, this still destroys it.","oracle_id":"a7e97fa9-4b72-4548-b854-5be5f18a6f1a","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
